1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,920
Haiti, explained like you are five.

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:06,160
In 1791, Haiti is called Saint-Domingue.

3
00:00:06,160 --> 00:00:07,520
It belongs to France.

4
00:00:07,520 --> 00:00:09,960
It is the richest colony in the world,

5
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:13,920
more sugar and coffee than every British colony combined.

6
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:16,800
It runs on half a million enslaved people.

7
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:21,760
In 1791, they revolt, not a riot, a revolution.

8
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:22,880
They defeat the French.

9
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:24,380
They defeat the British.

10
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:26,440
They defeat Napoleon's army,

11
00:00:26,440 --> 00:00:28,880
the same army that took Europe.

12
00:00:28,880 --> 00:00:31,000
In 1804, they win.

13
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,360
Haiti becomes the first nation on earth

14
00:00:33,360 --> 00:00:36,360
built by people who freed themselves.

15
00:00:36,360 --> 00:00:40,720
21 years later, French warships arrive, 14 of them,

16
00:00:40,720 --> 00:00:42,840
guns pointed at the coast.

17
00:00:42,840 --> 00:00:46,580
France has a demand, pay us for what we lost,

18
00:00:46,580 --> 00:00:50,600
the plantations, the ships, and the people.

19
00:00:50,600 --> 00:00:52,480
France wants to be paid for the humans

20
00:00:52,480 --> 00:00:57,000
who freed themselves, 150 million francs.

21
00:00:57,040 --> 00:01:00,320
10 times everything Haiti earns in a year.

22
00:01:00,320 --> 00:01:01,600
Haiti has no Navy.

23
00:01:01,600 --> 00:01:03,040
Haiti has no allies.

24
00:01:03,040 --> 00:01:05,760
No country will trade with it.

25
00:01:05,760 --> 00:01:07,360
Haiti says yes.

26
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:11,040
It borrows the money from French banks to pay France.

27
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:12,280
Haiti pays.

28
00:01:12,280 --> 00:01:14,660
It pays through the 1800s.

29
00:01:14,660 --> 00:01:16,880
It pays while it builds no schools.

30
00:01:16,880 --> 00:01:18,880
It pays while it builds no roads.

31
00:01:18,880 --> 00:01:21,880
It pays through an American occupation.

32
00:01:21,880 --> 00:01:25,760
It pays for 122 years.

33
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:29,520
The last payment is sent in 1947.

34
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:33,320
Today, Haiti is the poorest country in the Western hemisphere.

35
00:01:33,320 --> 00:01:35,040
It was never conquered.

36
00:01:35,040 --> 00:01:36,340
It was invoiced.

37
00:01:36,340 --> 00:01:39,320
And that's just one story inside Paladin.

38
00:01:39,320 --> 00:01:42,480
It's like Duolingo, but for history lovers,

39
00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:45,740
addictive, smart, surprisingly fun.

40
00:01:45,740 --> 00:01:48,620
Try it now and become the most intelligent person

41
00:01:48,620 --> 00:01:49,460
in the room.

